WEBVTT

00:14:58.196 --> 00:15:00.836
we must break down traditional silos.

00:15:00.876 --> 00:15:02.516
Because if we do,

00:15:02.516 --> 00:15:06.916
we may no longer be powerless
against these leading killers,

00:15:06.956 --> 00:15:11.716
but may, in fact find ways to treat
the world's two leading killers.

00:15:12.396 --> 00:15:13.556
Thank you.

00:15:13.596 --> 00:15:16.676
(Applause)